OL,3,GNEWSASearch for motorist after man dies
OL,4,Ain hit-and-run
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn investigation has been launched
OL,7,Fafter a man died in a hit-and-run on a
OL,8,Fbusy Birmingham road.
OL,10,FThe 68-year-old was hit by a
OL,11,Fdark-coloured vehicle on Stratford
OL,12,FRoad, in Hall Green, on Thursday
OL,13,Fevening, police said.
OL,15,FParamedics were unable to help the man,
OL,16,Fwho was found in critical condition,
OL,17,Fand he died at the scene.
OL,19,FAn investigation has been carried out
OL,20,Fovernight to try and identify the car
OL,21,Fand driver involved. A stretch of the
OL,22,Froad was closed but has since reopened.
OL,23,APub: 04-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
